      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense and heavy burden right now, and it is completely understandable that you feel this way when you are constantly under pressure. Please know that feeling \"stuck\" and deeply tired is a common sign of severe burnout, not a failure on your part.\n\nIt might be helpful to try and take a very small break, even if it is just 15 minutes to focus on a deep, slow breath away from everything.\n\nIf the feeling of exhaustion and pressure is overwhelming, please consider talking to a mental health professional to help you find ways to better manage this intense feeling of being out of fuel.",
